---
title: "Baton — UML Sequence: Webhook → Workflow Pipeline"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as ☁️ Event Source<br/>(Salesforce/HubSpot/...)
    participant Webhook as ⚡ Webhook Route<br/>/api/webhooks/{platform}<br/>/rule/:key · /app/:key
    participant Connector as 🔌 Verifier<br/>connector or app-catalog<br/>(HMAC / basic auth)
    participant DynamoDB as 🗄️ DynamoDB
    participant SQS_WH as 📨 SQS<br/>webhook-processing
    participant Worker as ⚙️ WebhookWorker
    participant RuleEngine as 🎯 RuleEngine
    participant SQS_WF as 📨 SQS<br/>workflow-launcher
    participant Launcher as 🚀 LauncherWorker
    participant Maestro as 📝 Docusign Workflow Builder
    participant Notifier as 🔔 NotificationService<br/>(in-app, Resend email, Slack)

    Note over Platform,Notifier: Event-Driven Pipeline

    Platform->>+Webhook: POST /api/webhooks/salesforce<br/>{event_type, record_id, ...} (raw body)
    Webhook->>+Connector: verifyWebhookSignature(rawBody, headers, secret)
    Connector-->>-Webhook: {valid: true}

    Webhook->>DynamoDB: Store raw event → webhook-events<br/>(duplicate detection / idempotency)
    Webhook-->>-Platform: 200 OK (immediately)
    Webhook->>DynamoDB: Inbound entry → trigger-pipeline<br/>status: "completed"
    Webhook->>SQS_WH: Enqueue {eventId, platform,<br/>orgId, connectionId}

    Note over SQS_WH,Worker: Async Processing

    SQS_WH->>+Worker: Poll message (long-poll 20s)
    Worker->>DynamoDB: Load event, skip if already processed
    Worker->>+Connector: extractEventInfo(payload)
    Connector-->>-Worker: {eventType: "lead.created",<br/>summary, recordId, metadata}

    Worker->>+RuleEngine: processEvent(orgId, platform, eventInfo)
    RuleEngine->>DynamoDB: Query automation-rules<br/>GSI: orgId, filter platform + active/paused
    DynamoDB-->>RuleEngine: Matching rules[]
    RuleEngine->>RuleEngine: evaluateConditions(rule, eventData)

    alt Rule is paused
        RuleEngine->>DynamoDB: Store → queued-webhooks<br/>(released when rule resumes)
    else Rule is active
        RuleEngine->>RuleEngine: mapFieldsToTriggerInputs(rule.actionConfig, eventData)
        RuleEngine->>DynamoDB: rule_match entry → trigger-pipeline<br/>status: "pending"
        RuleEngine->>SQS_WF: Enqueue {ruleId, workflowId,<br/>inputData, pipelineEntryId}
        RuleEngine->>DynamoDB: Increment rule.timesTriggered
    end
    RuleEngine-->>-Worker: {matchedRules, launchedWorkflows}
    Worker->>DynamoDB: Mark webhook-event processed
    Worker-->>-SQS_WH: Delete message (ack)

    SQS_WF->>+Launcher: Poll message
    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Get workflow + org's Docusign connection
    Launcher->>Launcher: Usage/relay gate check<br/>(denied → pipeline status: "skipped")
    Launcher->>Launcher: Decrypt access token<br/>(AES-256-GCM, refresh if expired)

    Launcher->>+Maestro: POST /v1/accounts/{acct}/workflows/{id}/actions/trigger<br/>{instanceName, triggerInputs}
    Maestro-->>-Launcher: {instanceId, instanceUrl}

    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Store instance → workflow-instances<br/>status: "running"
    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Update pipeline entry<br/>status: "completed"
    Launcher-->>-SQS_WF: Delete message (ack)

    Note over Launcher,Notifier: On launch failure — auto-retry with backoff<br/>2s/4s/8s/5m/15m/30m (max 6, pipeline status "retrying").<br/>Exhausted → status "failed" + failure notification

    Note over DynamoDB,Notifier: Instance completion — scheduler syncs running<br/>instances from Workflow Builder every 30s

    Maestro-->>DynamoDB: (via 30s sync) instance status<br/>completed / failed
    DynamoDB-->>Notifier: workflow_completed / workflow_failed
    Notifier->>Notifier: Store in-app notification,<br/>send Resend email and/or Slack message
